frontier large language models."},{"id":"08a443a0-328e-4c4c-b416-f2b605be6638","display":"DeepSeek","description":"Chinese AI lab known for cost-efficient open large language models."},{"id":"08c76092-fa1f-4f95-a40d-049a6ed0b09a","display":"SK Group","description":null},{"id":"08c9c095-94f4-4f2f-b7e3-f58774bab0cd","display":"Amkor","description":"Semiconductor packaging and test (OSAT) provider."},{"id":"09ecd3af-3354-4f7b-80bf-cfc2763d2cc8","display":"Era4","description":"UK AI data-centre developer using off-grid power (formerly Carbon3.ai)."},{"id":"0a3a520f-c6d0-417d-9e2f-b4f0a98ef043","display":"DreamActor-M1","description":"ByteDance AI model that animates still images into video."},{"id":"0aaf05ed-3fff-4c2a-880c-f1981e899f07","display":"EdgeConneX","description":"Global data-centre developer and operator."},{"id":"0b4ede22-11d3-4e92-ae77-197ea62694d6","display":"Koyeb","description":"Serverless GPU cloud platform."},{"id":"0bf7f2b1-d08e-4a5f-812e-772f55655989","display":"OpenAI","description":"AI lab behind ChatGPT and the GPT models; a primary driver of global compute demand."},{"id":"0c2404fc-0783-4a83-9623-75eff21f925b","display":"Blue Owl","description":"Alternative-asset manager active in data-centre financing."},{"id":"0d0232c0-08e4-439c-8cbe-ae0019198066","display":"Georgia Power","description":null},{"id":"0dd3dbf7-4ba0-4500-8d6b-6459df4c3471","display":"AirJoule","description":"Atmospheric water-harvesting technology firm."},{"id":"0e3e756a-a592-4466-90f0-a59839721be5","display":"Megaport","description":"Network-as-a-service provider for cloud connectivity."},{"id":"0efe338b-47d1-401c-b197-ce4bc2ffcca2","display":"Global Foundries","description":"US contract chip manufacturer specialising in mature-node foundry work."},{"id":"0fcfd0f0-2111-48cc-87c5-49b3fc4a604b","display":"Digital Ocean","description":"Developer-focused cloud provider adding GPU compute."},{"id":"113afef7-56cf-4264-811b-dc044f57a1e6","display":"Maxwell Labs","description":"Minnesota startup developing laser-based (photonic) cooling for AI chips."},{"id":"11a5aaad-88e6-485d-a2e0-b0a4e0b52c21","display":"Cosine","description":"AI coding-agent startup (Genie)."},{"id":"121482ce-b752-445d-a9c9-6864ccd707ae","display":"Midjourney","description":"Generative-AI image and video startup."},{"id":"126ba921-e082-4b27-9cda-3164e3da1305","display":"Oracle","description":"Enterprise software and OCI cloud provider expanding fast into AI data-centre capacity."},{"id":"127d5b17-5851-48d6-9e3c-f467ce893bf8","display":"MBZUAI","description":"Abu Dhabi university dedicated to artificial intelligence (MBZUAI)."},{"id":"12d4d7aa-a1ca-4560-a44a-a61cc9782626","display":"Qualcomm","description":"Mobile-chip leader moving into AI inference and data-centre accelerators."},{"id":"15013d34-2a49-4392-aa98-ff4f820f5282","display":"Olix","description":"UK startup building optical (photonic) AI inference chips."},{"id":"15825b1a-66c8-4d64-90b0-55739125bbb3","display":"Corvex","description":"GPU cloud (neocloud) startup."},{"id":"16d7e25d-f504-4327-94c9-03cf4ae52246","display":"MonolithAI","description":"AI platform for engineering test and simulation."},{"id":"1890a77b-12dd-43f8-85f4-1295eb561974","display":"Polarise","description":"European sovereign-AI data-centre and GPU cloud operator."},{"id":"19a62a53-219a-4433-bbc8-65922e11ace9","display":"Baseten","description":"AI inference infrastructure and model-serving platform."},{"id":"1acdae42-6d87-4a39-b242-3a1468829c71","display":"Zettabyte","description":"Taiwan-based GPUaaS provider and AI-infrastructure software firm."},{"id":"1afb2fcc-e76f-499d-8067-004aefd67222","display":"QIA","description":"Qatar Investment Authority; the Gulf state's sovereign wealth fund."},{"id":"1b0c3ff0-3e31-49ae-938a-a8c53783b0aa","display":"KIA","description":"South Korean automaker."},{"id":"1c436eed-048d-4d45-8d20-d958babf76ce","display":"Aramco Ventures","description":"Corporate venture arm of Saudi Aramco."},{"id":"1c71afcc-196c-4807-8ecf-